              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Findings",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
                      "color": "#1E2532"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1. In about 40% of rows (3,886 of 9,648), Total Sales is exactly 10× Price per Unit × Units Sold, including every In-Store row. Revenue measures use Total Sales as reported; confirm the authoritative definition with the data owner.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#4E5B70"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2. Retailer ID is not a unique key (the same ID is shared by Foot Locker, Kohl's, Sports Direct and Walmart), so retailers are identified by name.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#4E5B70"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3. 2021 has 8,346 transactions against 1,302 in 2020. Year-over-year growth may partly reflect how much activity was recorded.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#4E5B70"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "4. Cost is implied as Total Sales minus Operating Profit; there is no cost, budget, order ID, ship date or order status column.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#4E5B70"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
